== Effect ==
* {{E|Bomb}}s leave [[green creep]] underneath themselves.
* {{dlc|r}} The creep deals 23.3 damage per tick.
* {{transformation contribution|Bob|dlc=r+|this=trinket}}

== Notes ==
* Bombs will leave a trail of creep when moved or pushed around until they explode.
* {{dlc+|r+}} The {{A|Golden Trinket}} or the {{i|Mom's Box}} combination will not count as multiple items of the transformation.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Creep pool is slightly larger.
** If Isaac has both a golden trinket and the Box, the creep also lasts longer.
* {{I|Dr. Fetus}}: Bombs from Dr. Fetus leave creep, allowing for extra damage.
* {{I|Remote Detonator}}: Bombs will continue to leave creep until they are manually detonated. Allows for maximization of creep damage, potentially dealing more damage over time to a boss than just a singular bomb.
* {{I|Rocket in a Jar}}: Fired Rockets leave creep.
* {{I|Scatter Bombs}}: Tiny bombs will also create creep, allowing for a larger area of effect.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Bob's Rotten Head}}: No effect.
* {{I|Epic Fetus}}: No effect.
* {{I|Mr. Mega}}: Does not produce bigger creep puddles.
* {{e|Throwable Bomb}}s from {{E|Bomb Grimace|n}}s do not leave creep.

